<node id="1189914" title="Re^2: How do you use Net::OpenSSH to query mysql database via ssh tunnel" created="2017-05-09 10:57:34" updated="2017-05-09 10:57:34" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="446266">salva</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">[mod://Net::OpenSSH] does not directly supports creating TCP redirections, but they can be created using ssh &lt;c&gt;forward&lt;/c&gt; control command:

&lt;c&gt;
$ssh-&gt;system({ssh_opts =&gt; [-O =&gt; 'forward', '-L4022:localhost:22']})
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
